        "original_id": "35ba2c86-6cf2-5020-a82d-b38a813beb8a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Baidu Baike, Chinese Wikipedia\n- Organizations: Wikimedia Foundation\n- Concepts: Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures, Internet meme\n- Places: People's Republic of China\n\nFacts:\n- Baidu Baike released its test version on 20 April 2006.\n- Within three weeks of its 20 April 2006 test release, Baidu Baike grew to more than 90,000 articles and surpassed Chinese Wikipedia in article count.\n- Chinese Wikipedia is the Standard Chinese-language edition of Wikipedia.\n- Chinese Wikipedia is run by the Wikimedia Foundation.\n- The Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures was initially a humorous hoax from Baidu Baike.\n- In early 2009, the Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures became a popular and widespread Internet meme in the People's Republic of China.",
